# Force Mockito's inline mock maker for api tests. Needed for Mockito.mockStatic (e.g. PihEncounterSaveHandlerTest,
# AddPatientToQueueActionTest).
#
# The test classpath has two competing mockito-extensions/org.mockito.plugins.MockMaker files: mock-maker-inline from
# the openmrs-api tests jar (2.8.9+), and PowerMockMaker from powermock-api-mockito2, which does not support static
# mocks. Mockito picks one per JVM, so without this file the winner depended on test order, and mockStatic failed with
# "The used MockMaker PowerMockMaker does not support the creation of static mocks" in a full `mvn clean install`.
# See UHM-9639.
mock-maker-inline
